flowchart TB
  %% SlideForge / SlideCheck Workflow (Paper2Slides + Julep)

  A[Input: PDF / PPTX Slide Deck] --> B[Paper2Slides استخراج/Parsing]
  B --> C[Structured Deck JSON\n(DeckForEvaluation)]

  subgraph J[Julep Orchestrator (Agentic Workflow)]
    C --> D[SlideNormalizer\nNormalize & clean fields]
    D --> E[SectionTagger\nAssign section per slide\n+ confidence]
    E --> F[KeywordChecker\nCheck required keywords\n+ evidence]
    F --> G[ComplianceDecider\nPASS / NEEDS_UPDATE / FAIL\n+ recommendations]
  end

  G --> H[Compliance Report\n(JSON + human-readable)]

  %% Optional generation branch
  H -->|Optional: Auto-fix enabled| I[Slide Generator Agent\nGenerate missing sections/slides\nDraft improved content]
  I --> K[Updated Deck Output\n(PPTX / Markdown / JSON)]
  H -->|No auto-fix| L[Action Items for Authors\n(Jira tickets / checklist updates)]

  %% Optional integrations
  K --> M[Export / Publish\nGitHub PR, Confluence, SharePoint]
  L --> M

